# Efficient agent workflow

- Inspect only files related to the task. Do not scan the full repository unless asked.
- For non-trivial work, inspect first and give a concise plan before editing. Implement only approved scope.
- One small step at a time. Prefer exact paths and existing patterns in `src/main.jsx` / `src/styles.css`.
- Prefer `npm run build` over starting a long-running preview. Do not leave `vite` / `preview` running in the background unless the user asked for a server.
- Do not dump full npm logs; show failing lines only.
- Report changed files, what was verified, and limitations.
- After two failed implementation attempts, stop editing and hand off: goal, files inspected, attempted changes, current failure, next investigation.
